{"material_id": "ntce.youer.baojiao.2022a.q11.material.recovered", "text": "材料：某大班几个小朋友在讨论有关动物的问题。老师问：“你们刚才说了很多动物，我想问问，到底什么是动物？”丁丁说：“我们刚才说的大象、猴子、孔雀、斑马都是动物！”鹏鹏说：“动物有的有腿，有的有翅膀，有的会跑，有的会飞，有的会在水里游...”蓝蓝马上接着说：“有的吃草，有的吃米，有的喜欢吃肉...”睿睿说：“我觉得会自己动的，会吃东西的，都是动物。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "bbe70bfa06f16d4876cd7a75db1590e4f9f60398896e59fc392a21560027c0b1", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 950, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1123, "next_source_question_number": 14, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 11, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "bbe70bfa06f16d4876cd7a75db1590e4f9f60398896e59fc392a21560027c0b1"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.2022a.q11"], "knowledge_node_ids": [], "ability_ids": [], "exam_requirement_ids": [], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.2022a.q11"], "word_count": 173, "level": "youer", "subject": "baojiao", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "bbe70bfa06f16d4876cd7a75db1590e4f9f60398896e59fc392a21560027c0b1", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 950, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1123, "next_source_question_number": 14, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 11, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "bbe70bfa06f16d4876cd7a75db1590e4f9f60398896e59fc392a21560027c0b1"}], "type": "真题", "copyright": {"authorization_status": "unknown", "hold