{"material_id": "ntce.youer.baojiao.2022a.q12.material.recovered", "text": "大班的江老师出差两天，回来以后，孩子们都过来告亮亮的状，说亮亮总是搞破坏。亮亮说我不是在搞破坏，我是孙悟空，我在打妖怪。晶晶说，我不是妖怪，我是唐僧，其他孩子也说我不是妖怪，我是玉皇大帝。还有的说我也是孙悟空，我要扮演孙悟空。孩子七嘴八舌，早就忘记了告状这件事。都在讨论自己要扮演什么。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "bbe70bfa06f16d4876cd7a75db1590e4f9f60398896e59fc392a21560027c0b1", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1335, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1478, "next_source_question_number": 16, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 12, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "bbe70bfa06f16d4876cd7a75db1590e4f9f60398896e59fc392a21560027c0b1"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.2022a.q12"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.m5.k01", "ntce.youer.baojiao.m6.k01"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.youer.ability.design", "ntce.youer.ability.manage"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.102.r001", "ntce.outline.102.r006", "ntce.outline.102.r007"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.2022a.q12"], "word_count": 143, "level": "youer", "subject": "baojiao", "kind": "lesson_plan_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "bbe70bfa06f16d4876cd7a75db1590e4f9f60398896e59fc392a21560027c0b1", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1335, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1478, "next_source_question_number": 16, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 12, "alignment_statu